Existing pilot cropped/registered images and image-bound masks. Stored voxel arrays and source affines are preserved, without new registration or cropping. Variant names retain their original numerical labels; those labels have not been independently revalidated. Anatomical meanings of numerical segmentation labels were not documented in the supplied pilot folder.

The pilot01 session01 VIBE comparison images use the available session02 scanner reference. They are derived comparison images, not an independently acquired session01 VIBE scan.
